# Translation of the Museum of Alternative Displays into Português.
# How to work on this file: TRANSLATING.md at the top of the repository.
# 
# Português (Brasil). Brazilian Portuguese, with the visitor addressed as "você".
# A picture surface is a "tela", the device as a kind and a readout of fixed segments are a "display", a board is a "painel".
# A hall is a "sala". The visitor's own room, for the view in augmented reality, is "o seu espaço".
# A glass tube with a glow in it is a "tubo", so that "válvula" stays free for the light valves of hall 4.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Museum of Alternative Displays\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://github.com/obartra/museum-of-alternative-displays/issues\n"
"Language: pt_BR\n"
"Language-Team: Português\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\n"

