msgid "Cut to {n} seconds, re-encoded"
msgstr "Filme cortado para {n} segundos e recodificado"

#: archive
#. What was done to an archive picture or film before it was put on the site.
msgctxt "changes.2"
msgid "Resized"
msgstr "Imagem redimensionada"

#: archive
